  data: {
    LLM: "Prioritize melding your high cards (Kings, Queens) first to reduce your point total in case someone else wins.\n\nKeep a 7 in your hand until you can use it to 'close' out a hand or as a safe exit. Melding a 7 alone is a good way to reduce your count.\n\nThe 'Battle' strategy: Don't just take the discard because you need it; take it to prevent an opponent from matching it if they are close to emptying their hand.",
    Player: "Prioritize melding your high cards (Kings, Queens) first to reduce your point total in case someone else wins.\n\nKeep a 7 in your hand until you can use it to 'close' out a hand or as a safe exit. Melding a 7 alone is a good way to reduce your count.\n\nThe 'Battle' strategy: Don't just take the discard because you need it; take it to prevent an opponent from matching it if they are close to emptying their hand.",
